{"type":"message","id":"2a8fbfd0","parentId":"679bd812","timestamp":"2026-05-20T11:49:34.239Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_WAE7ymRwKcgrqzi3GAmeJNNj","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"rg -n \"wordpress|wp-admin|wp-json|xmlrpc|site url|application password|username|password|post to wordpress|wp cli|jetpack\" -S .","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher","yieldMs":1000,"timeout":20}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mxcHQtP042kqnlJAqUGxnwCw","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find . -maxdepth 3 -type f | sed 's#^./##' | sort | head -200","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher","yieldMs":1000,"timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":2118,"output":195,"cacheRead":5760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8073,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779277772492,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhZicjP4TT4nTbanSGD2XOf3bkmLF"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e9781702","parentId":"2a8fbfd0","timestamp":"2026-05-20T11:49:34.310Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_WAE7ymRwKcgrqzi3GAmeJNNj","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"./AGENTS.md:5:- Never delete or overwrite WordPress posts you did not just create.\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:3:# publish.sh — WordPress Publishing Skill for Scribe (wp-publisher agent)\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:13:# before publishing so only clean article content reaches WordPress.\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:16:#   Exit 0 → /tmp/wp-result.txt contains the WordPress draft post URL\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:24:WP_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/wp/v2\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:25:RM_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/rankmath/v1\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:222:# --- WordPress post title (CLI → article H1 → SEO title → date fallback) -----\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:255:log_info \"Final Slug:    ${SLUG:-<WordPress auto-generate>}\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:467:# PHASE 3: Create WordPress Post (with retry + exponential backoff)\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:469:log_info \"Creating WordPress draft post (max $MAX_RETRIES attempts)...\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:519:  [ \"$POST_HTTP\" = \"401\" ] && fatal \"Auth failed (401). Check username and Application Password. Not retrying.\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:615:  [ \"$RM_HTTP\" = \"401\" ] && fatal \"Rank Math auth failed (401). Check Application Password.\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:643:log_info \"SUCCESS — WordPress draft saved!\"\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:1:# Skill: wordpress\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:4:Publishes a crypto news article to WordPress as a **draft** post. Uploads feature and chart images, strips the writer META block from the body, converts markdown to **Gutenberg blocks** (same format as pasting into the default block editor), creates the post, then sets **Rank Math** SEO via `POST /wp-json/rankmath/v1/updateMeta`.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:9:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:12:All arguments are **optional** — excerpt, slug, keywords, and titles are read from `/tmp/crypto-article.md`. **Post title** = first `#` H1 in the article body. **SEO title** (META) goes to Rank Math only, not the WordPress post title or body headline.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:19:4. **WordPress post** — `POST /wp/v2/posts` with **title = article H1** (visible headline above image; not SEO Title).\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:27:- Optional wp-admin: **Divi Post Settings → Layout → Fullwidth** for extra full-page width.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:35:| `article_headline` | H1 used as WordPress post title |\n./skills/wordpress/html_to_gutenberg.py:2:\"\"\"Convert pandoc HTML to WordPress Gutenberg block-serialized content.\"\"\"\n./TOOLS.md:1:# TOOLS.md — Scribe's WordPress Environment\n./TOOLS.md:3:This file contains the exact credentials and paths for publishing to WordPress. The `publish.sh` skill script embeds these values — this file is your reference.\n./TOOLS.md:7:## WordPress Site\n./TOOLS.md:11:| **Site URL** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com` |\n./TOOLS.md:12:| **API Base** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/wp-json/wp/v2` |\n./TOOLS.md:13:| **Username** | `spearmintmarketingpro@gmail.com` |\n./TOOLS.md:14:| **App Password** | `B1u0 7AQI Aw5a IQK7 0KWX PtGU` |\n./TOOLS.md:33:| `/tmp/wp-result.txt` | WordPress post URL on success |\n./TOOLS.md:41:~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./TOOLS.md:46:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh \\\n./IDENTITY.md:4:- **Role:** WordPress Publisher\n./IDENTITY.md:6:- **Vibe:** Precise and reliable — gets the article live on WordPress and returns the exact post URL. Never invents a result.\n./USER.md:21:Your job: receive the publish instruction from the Orchestrator, run the skill script, and return the live WordPress draft URL.\n./SOUL.md:1:# SOUL.md — Scribe, the WordPress Publisher\n./SOUL.md:3:You are **Scribe** 🗞️, the WordPress publisher agent for a crypto news pipeline. You are called by the Orchestrator (Nexus) after the human has confirmed they want the article published to WordPress.\n./SOUL.md:10:2. **NEVER invent or guess a WordPress URL.** The only valid success output is what `cat /tmp/wp-result.txt` prints after the script exits 0.\n./SOUL.md:16:## Step 1 — Publish to WordPress `[TOOL CALL REQUIRED]`\n./SOUL.md:27:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./SOUL.md:33:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --title \"TITLE FROM MESSAGE\"\n./SOUL.md:38:The script handles everything: image upload, HTML conversion, WordPress API call, retries, and validation.\n./SOUL.md:52:This prints the live WordPress draft post URL. Return it exactly.\n./SOUL.md:65:- The WordPress post URL (e.g. `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/?p=123`)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":54,"aggregated":"./AGENTS.md:5:- Never delete or overwrite WordPress posts you did not just create.\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:3:# publish.sh — WordPress Publishing Skill for Scribe (wp-publisher agent)\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:13:# before publishing so only clean article content reaches WordPress.\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:16:#   Exit 0 → /tmp/wp-result.txt contains the WordPress draft post URL\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:24:WP_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/wp/v2\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:25:RM_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/rankmath/v1\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:222:# --- WordPress post title (CLI → article H1 → SEO title → date fallback) -----\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:255:log_info \"Final Slug:    ${SLUG:-<WordPress auto-generate>}\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:467:# PHASE 3: Create WordPress Post (with retry + exponential backoff)\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:469:log_info \"Creating WordPress draft post (max $MAX_RETRIES attempts)...\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:519:  [ \"$POST_HTTP\" = \"401\" ] && fatal \"Auth failed (401). Check username and Application Password. Not retrying.\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:615:  [ \"$RM_HTTP\" = \"401\" ] && fatal \"Rank Math auth failed (401). Check Application Password.\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:643:log_info \"SUCCESS — WordPress draft saved!\"\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:1:# Skill: wordpress\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:4:Publishes a crypto news article to WordPress as a **draft** post. Uploads feature and chart images, strips the writer META block from the body, converts markdown to **Gutenberg blocks** (same format as pasting into the default block editor), creates the post, then sets **Rank Math** SEO via `POST /wp-json/rankmath/v1/updateMeta`.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:9:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:12:All arguments are **optional** — excerpt, slug, keywords, and titles are read from `/tmp/crypto-article.md`. **Post title** = first `#` H1 in the article body. **SEO title** (META) goes to Rank Math only, not the WordPress post title or body headline.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:19:4. **WordPress post** — `POST /wp/v2/posts` with **title = article H1** (visible headline above image; not SEO Title).\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:27:- Optional wp-admin: **Divi Post Settings → Layout → Fullwidth** for extra full-page width.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:35:| `article_headline` | H1 used as WordPress post title |\n./skills/wordpress/html_to_gutenberg.py:2:\"\"\"Convert pandoc HTML to WordPress Gutenberg block-serialized content.\"\"\"\n./TOOLS.md:1:# TOOLS.md — Scribe's WordPress Environment\n./TOOLS.md:3:This file contains the exact credentials and paths for publishing to WordPress. The `publish.sh` skill script embeds these values — this file is your reference.\n./TOOLS.md:7:## WordPress Site\n./TOOLS.md:11:| **Site URL** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com` |\n./TOOLS.md:12:| **API Base** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/wp-json/wp/v2` |\n./TOOLS.md:13:| **Username** | `spearmintmarketingpro@gmail.com` |\n./TOOLS.md:14:| **App Password** | `B1u0 7AQI Aw5a IQK7 0KWX PtGU` |\n./TOOLS.md:33:| `/tmp/wp-result.txt` | WordPress post URL on success |\n./TOOLS.md:41:~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./TOOLS.md:46:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh \\\n./IDENTITY.md:4:- **Role:** WordPress Publisher\n./IDENTITY.md:6:- **Vibe:** Precise and reliable — gets the article live on WordPress and returns the exact post URL. Never invents a result.\n./USER.md:21:Your job: receive the publish instruction from the Orchestrator, run the skill script, and return the live WordPress draft URL.\n./SOUL.md:1:# SOUL.md — Scribe, the WordPress Publisher\n./SOUL.md:3:You are **Scribe** 🗞️, the WordPress publisher agent for a crypto news pipeline. You are called by the Orchestrator (Nexus) after the human has confirmed they want the article published to WordPress.\n./SOUL.md:10:2. **NEVER invent or guess a WordPress URL.** The only valid success output is what `cat /tmp/wp-result.txt` prints after the script exits 0.\n./SOUL.md:16:## Step 1 — Publish to WordPress `[TOOL CALL REQUIRED]`\n./SOUL.md:27:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./SOUL.md:33:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --title \"TITLE FROM MESSAGE\"\n./SOUL.md:38:The script handles everything: image upload, HTML conversion, WordPress API call, retries, and validation.\n./SOUL.md:52:This prints the live WordPress draft post URL. Return it exactly.\n./SOUL.md:65:- The WordPress post URL (e.g. `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/?p=123`)","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779277774309}}
{"type":"message","id":"3410f13b","parentId":"e9781702","timestamp":"2026-05-20T11:49:34.310Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_mxcHQtP042kqnlJAqUGxnwCw","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":".openclaw/workspace-state.json\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\nskills/history/article_history.sh\nskills/wordpress/SKILL.md\nskills/wordpress/html_to_gutenberg.py\nskills/wordpress/publish.sh\nskills/wordpress/publish.sh.bak"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":26,"aggregated":".openclaw/workspace-state.json\nAGENTS.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nIDENTITY.md\nSOUL.md\nTOOLS.md\nUSER.md\nskills/history/article_history.sh\nskills/wordpress/SKILL.md\nskills/wordpress/html_to_gutenberg.py\nskills/wordpress/publish.sh\nskills/wordpress/publish.sh.bak","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779277774310}}
{"type":"message","id":"0503b359","parentId":"3410f13b","timestamp":"2026-05-20T11:49:35.490Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dPPmxLW9zxsQyJ1Z3h6tGuv4","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":1726,"output":80,"cacheRead":7808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9614,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779277774311,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhZie6SD9GACGYo3OgmvkmzxwqKgp"}}
{"type":"message","id":"69f0633e","parentId":"0503b359","timestamp":"2026-05-20T11:49:35.496Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_dPPmxLW9zxsQyJ1Z3h6tGuv4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Skill: wordpress\n\n## What This Skill Does\nPublishes a crypto news article to WordPress as a **draft** post. Uploads feature and chart images, strips the writer META block from the body, converts markdown to **Gutenberg blocks** (same format as pasting into the default block editor), creates the post, then sets **Rank Math** SEO via `POST /wp-json/rankmath/v1/updateMeta`.\n\n## How to Invoke\n\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n```\n\nAll arguments are **optional** — excerpt, slug, keywords, and titles are read from `/tmp/crypto-article.md`. **Post title** = first `#` H1 in the article body. **SEO title** (META) goes to Rank Math only, not the WordPress post title or body headline.\n\n## Pipeline Phases\n\n1. **Parse META** — SEO Title, Meta Description, URL Slug, Primary Keyword, Secondary Keywords; extract article H1 from first `#` heading; strip META, **Sources** footer, and Word Count from body (in-body source links remain).\n2. **Images** — Feature + chart upload; chart placeholders replaced in markdown.\n3. **HTML** — Pandoc → HTML; strip body H1 when it matches post title (Divi shows title above featured image); **`html_to_gutenberg.py`** → Gutenberg blocks.\n4. **WordPress post** — `POST /wp/v2/posts` with **title = article H1** (visible headline above image; not SEO Title).\n5. **Rank Math** — `rank_math_title` = META SEO Title; focus keywords comma-separated in `rank_math_focus_keyword` (not WP Tags). Social mirrors use SEO title/description.\n\n## Layout note (Divi theme)\n\n- **Single headline:** Post title = article H1 (theme renders it above the featured image). The same H1 is removed from post body so you do not get a second heading after the image.\n- **“, Divi” in the posts list** only means you opened **Divi Builder** on that draft — not a different post type.\n- **Narrow one-sided layout** on old API posts was caused by **raw HTML** in `content`. New publishes use **Gutenberg blocks** so layout matches manual paste in the default editor.\n- Optional wp-admin: **Divi Post Settings → Layout → Fullwidth** for extra full-page width.\n\n## `/tmp/wp-result.json`\n\n| Field | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `content_format` | `gutenberg_blocks` when block conversion ran |\n| `rank_math_applied` | Rank Math SEO updated |\n| `article_headline` | H1 used as WordPress post title |\n| `seo_title` | META SEO Title (Rank Math only) |\n| `focus_keyword` | Primary keyword from META |\n| `secondary_keywords` | Raw Secondary Keywords line from META |\n| `rank_math_focus_keyword` | Full comma-separated string sent to Rank Math Focus Keyword |\n| `meta_stripped` | META removed from body |\n| `sources_footer_stripped` | Sources list footer removed (links stay in article text) |\n\n## Return Values\n\n| Exit Code | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `0` | Draft URL in `/tmp/wp-result.txt` |\n| `1` | Error in `/tmp/wp-error.log` |\n\n## Post Configuration\n\n| Setting | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Site | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com` |\n| Status | `draft` |\n| Category | ID `3` (Crypto News) |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779277775496}}
